{"id":"b42e3255afbaa50d","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-odd-order.md","title":"Odd Order","display":"df-odd-order — Odd Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-odd-order","aliases":["58-df-odd-order","Odd Order"],"display":"df-odd-order — Odd Order","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-odd-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-odd-order</span><span>Odd Order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-odd-order — Odd Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\cdot\\in V\">\\(G,\\cdot\\in V\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OddOrderGroup}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{OddOrderGroup}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 是保留群运算的精确谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OddOrder}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{OddOrder}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> 是其存在投影。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}odd\\text{-}order\\text{-}group} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{OddOrderGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(|G|=2n+1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}odd\\text{-}order\\text{-}group} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{OddOrderGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(|G|=2n+1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}odd\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{OddOrder}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\cdot\\in V\\;\\operatorname{OddOrderGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}odd\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{OddOrder}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\cdot\\in V\\;\\operatorname{OddOrderGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>精确核心保留群运算；一元谓词只断言该载体上存在一个奇数阶群结构。</li>\n<li>Odd order: finite cardinality not divisible by 2.</li>\n<li>Feit-Thompson: massive 1963 proof using character theory</li>\n<li>Implies: all non-abelian simple groups have even order</li>\n<li>Classification: all finite simple groups have even order except cyclic of prime order</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Feit and Thompson, Solvable Groups</li>\n<li>Isaacs, Character Theory of Finite Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,\\cdot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OddOrderGroup}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OddOrder}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}odd\\text{-}order\\text{-}group} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{OddOrderGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(|G|=2n+1)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}odd\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{OddOrder}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\cdot\\in V\\;\\operatorname{OddOrderGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)","display":true}],"bytes":1446,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-897","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-odd-order.md|58-df-odd-order]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["ed71f39f59370734","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}